        "language": "english",
        "review": "A cute, short & basic platforming game. \r\nMusics & visuals are nice. The level design gives you a lot of space to move around so you have margin for error, which makes me think this game should be a good fit for beginners. \r\nThe kitty on bird animation is a bit long but it does make the heart throb slightly each time as I wonder if I'm gonna make the next jump. There are a lot of kitty skins to play with (I almost wish there weren't that many unlocked at the start so that we could discover more). \r\nI was a bit sad to see there was no cutscene/ending screen when clearing everything, even if there's an achievement. The level design is rather simple, there's not that many variations of challenges to clear, so I hope the dev will improve that for their next game.",
